    {
      "id": "127566fd-7f66-4a33-a64d-30b9ebea6d2f",
      "text": "At the hostel I met three friends from northeast India who were traveling together (Namin, Bhaskar, and \"Sony\"). They were super friendly and were trying to help me plan my trip to Pokhara. They also suggested I try to visit Kolkata during a huge festival going on now until October 21st. We went out for lunch together and got Thali, which is a plate with rice in the middle and several sides around it (spinach, curried vegetables, mutton, dal).",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "1fe02430-e9ba-4b68-afe1-c2197be789b4",
      "type": "photos",
      "photos": [
