          "width": 1200,
          "height": 1600,
          "caption": "Thali with travelers",
          "thumbPath": "84a2bb32-a7fc-40fe-93ff-302be175640d/2026-10-13/2a59a28b-bdf9-4c68-9fa7-6c2f24457d42_thumb.jpg"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bfd86e4b-669e-4e33-bfbd-e609fbb52ad2",
      "text": "After lunch, I got cab (1 hour) to check out the Chandragiri cable car. The cable car goes up 1000 meters and you get stunning views of the surrounding mountains. At the top the atmosphere felt a bit like an amusement park. There were food vendors and small rides for kids, alongside a Hindu temple. I took a short 200m zipline over the mountains for ~$5. A quick thrill!",
      "type": "text"
    },
